  - title: ORIENTATION
    level: Orientation
    brief: 'COMBAT BRIEFING.

      Commander, welcome to the battle group. INDRA,
      VARUNA and MARUT are with you.


      A quick mop-up patrol. Standard thing.
      Before we move, run the orientation checklist: flying, sensors, power. Each
      part you finish opens more of the patrol area. Then take point to the target
      zone.'
